[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=27 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="卸完第一批箱子，工人拿来一张沾水的收货单，请你们确认。纸上写着十二只箱子，码头上却有十三只。多的一只比别的干净，顶上压着一块砖。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="有人多送了一箱？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="不知道。昨晚的船下完货就走了，今天才发现。要是白捡，倒也挺好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先别入账。问问夜班，砖是谁放的，货是谁接的。多出来的东西也可能有人在找。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="夜班的姑娘刚下工，披着外套坐在桥边打盹。管事喊了两次，她才反应过来。她说砖是自己放的，因为那只箱子有个坏扣，怕被风掀开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你见过里面？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="夜班姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="里面的布很旧，底下像是书。我没继续看，单子上没它。想等人来问，后来就睡着了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她不好意思地站起来，管事却让她继续坐，说没把不明东西送进滤水仓就够了。你问他们会不会因为查一只不值钱的箱子耽误开工，姑娘摇头，指向舱口一块新补的铁皮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="夜班姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="上回有人把废电池当金属料下去了。那几天我们喝水全得绕到另一条桥。问一嘴，没那么费事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把箱子移到干燥处，当着接货人打开。里面不是书，是一叠孩子用的画板，背面涂黑，能拿白石画；最下面压着一封没写寄件人的信。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="“给搬到堤道的几家人，原先教室的东西搬不完，只剩这些。不要烧。”"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="幸好没送熔料箱。那边什么烧起来都一样黑，看不出来是作业。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="夜班收货的记录留着，问问迁过来的住户有没有人认得。今天把画板搬进公共屋，别一人领一块走，先让孩子们一起用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="男孩在旁边听完，抬头问画板是不是也要签名。管事说借出去要记，留在屋里画不必。他于是认真挑了一块最破的，问破的那块能不能拿来补自己家的窗。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你想拿它堵窗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="男孩"

text="不是。放窗下面，妹妹够不到桌子。她画的时候总踩我的书。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿跟着他去看窗台，回来把最稳的那块换给他。她没有把这叫一次援助，只拿笔在借用单上添了句“作垫板用，不接近明火”，让他念一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这样不算改变用途？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="算。所以得记下来。东西要适合活着的人用，不是我们今天给它写好名字，它以后就不能换个地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="收货单最后从十二只改成十三只，多出来那只单独注明。你把木板搬进公共屋时，看见墙上还有上一批孩子留下的刻痕，没对齐，也不漂亮，却没有被新漆盖掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们回程要带灯芯。这边腾出一个干货位，先铺布，不要让工人临时抱着箱子等船。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你还在想回程？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="他们把货交给我们以后，还得回来过日子。今天先安排好，回来的人就不用再吵一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你试着在海图旁边添一张陆上的小表。谁在等，东西放哪儿，谁接班。它看上去不像指挥，却能让很多原本只是“顺便”的事终于有一个落点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

